    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikisila ŋice ŋulu amaikina kiwuapae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimu Ekapolon Akuj nu ebe, “Alotooma ŋirwa ŋikanikapei ŋulu itiyaere, emaikina egolitoe epuke ŋolo elomunere nalapatu ŋina alotooma alowae a ŋolo alo Kide, nai ani edoli akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, emaikina toŋaarae ka akoloŋit ŋina elomunia elap ŋolokitete, emaikina toŋaarae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ekepukan tolomu nalapatu ŋina a epuke a ŋolo alo Kide, towo alodiyete ŋakito ŋuna a epuke a ŋol. Emaikina nai ŋisacaradotin inakis Ekapolon ŋainakineta a ekepukan ŋuna epeyo ka ŋuna a ekisil, ido emaikina nai ekepukan toryedik kilip alopuke. Ani kedau akilip, toloma kiŋa, nai nyemaikina togoloi epuke akitodol eboŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ŋituŋa ka akwap a Isirael toryediko kilipa alokiŋaren Ekapolon alopuke a ŋol ŋirwa ŋulu a Sabato ka ŋirwa ŋulu elomunia elap ŋolokitete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo ŋuna emaikina ekepukan tolemu aŋuna ke Ekapolon akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato ikes nu: Ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin ŋikanikapei ŋulu nyeŋwalito, emesek ŋolo nyeŋwalit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikinyom ŋulu imorikinio ka emesek ŋakiloi ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaarei, ŋikinyom ŋulu imorikinio ka ŋikaalei ŋulumesekin etyae daadaŋ ŋolo ecamit iŋes, emaikina eyai akimyet ŋilitae ŋiomwon a ŋinakilo a ŋikinyom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli akoloŋit ŋina elomunia elap ŋolokitete, emaikina ekepukan ya neni ke Ekapolon emoŋ ŋolosorokit ŋolo nyeŋwalit ka ŋikaalei ŋikanikapei ŋulumesekin ta emesek, emaikina ŋul daadaŋ erae ŋulu nyeŋwalito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iŋes tolemu ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom apeikilo aŋuna ke emoŋ a epei, apeikilo aŋuna a emesek a epei ka ŋakiloi daadaŋ ŋuna ecamit iŋes aŋuna a ŋikaalei a ŋulumesekin, emaikina eyai akimyet ŋilitae ŋiomwon a ŋinakilo a ŋikinyom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elomuni ekepukan nalapatu ŋina alotooma, emaikina iŋes kitoru nagule ŋina a epuke ka ani eboŋori kiŋa, emaikina kitor nenipei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ani epote Ŋisirael kiŋaren Ekapolon anapakio aŋuna a ŋasuban a ŋuna emaikina kitiyaetei, emaikina ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini elomuni akilip nalapatu ŋina alotooma alopuke a ŋolo alo Kuju kitor lopuke ŋolo alo Kwap eboŋori ka ŋini elomuni akilip nalapatu ŋin alopuke a ŋolo alo Kwap kitor lopuke ŋolo alo Kuju. Nyemaikina ŋituŋa kitoro lopukei ŋulu sek alomuniata ikes tooma nalapatu, nai emaikina tocorota kiropo alopuke a ŋoloce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina ani elomunete ikes tooma, tolomu ekepukan daŋ tooma kaapei ka ikes ka ani elomarete ikes kiŋa, toloma ekepukan daŋ kiŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Anasuban a ŋuna ikicikakinitae akitiya anapakio a ŋuna eseunitae, emaikina ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ŋina erae akilo, tolemunae aŋuna a emoŋ a epei, akilo apei aŋuna a emesek a epei ka ŋakiloi daadaŋ ŋuna ecamit ituŋanan aŋuna a ŋikaalei a ŋulumesekin, emaikina eyai akimyet ŋilitae ŋiomwon a ŋinakilo a ŋikinyom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elemuni ekepukan ainakinet ŋina ka acamit keŋ, kerae ŋina epeyo, kori ŋainakineta ŋuna a ekisil ikwapei ŋuna elemuni iŋes neni ke Ekapolon erae ŋainakineta ŋuna ka acamit keŋ, emaikina toŋaarae epuke ŋolo alo Kide aŋuna a ekepukan, tosodi nai ekepukan inak Ekapolon ainakinet keŋ ŋina epeyo, kori ŋainakineta ŋuna a ekisil lopite ŋolo sek itiyaa iŋes akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato. Ekaku, emaikina iŋes toloma kiŋa, ani keloma iŋes kiŋa, emaikina togoloi epuke ŋol.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emaikina iŋes tolemu ikale ŋinimesek ŋini erae ekaru epei ŋini nyeŋwalit, ŋini erae ainakinet ŋina epeyo aŋuna ke Ekapolon a ŋinakoloŋit. Emaikina tolemununu ŋin a ŋinataparacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iŋes tolemununu a ŋinataparacu ikwapei ainakinet ŋina a ŋikinyom ŋakirya ŋuna erae ŋakiloi ŋaarei kaapei alita apei ŋina ka akimyet aŋuna ka akiguryo ŋakirya. Emaikina ŋun kitiyae neni a Ekapolon ŋikaru ka ŋikaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, emaikina ainakinet ŋina a ikale, ŋina a ŋikinyom ka ŋina ka akimyet erae ŋuna elemununuyo a ŋinataparacu ikwapei ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo a ŋinakoloŋit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alimu Ekapolon Akuj atemar, ani kelemu ekepukan ibore keŋ idio erae ainakinet a ŋuna alokoku keŋ a edio, eruwor ainakinet ŋin ŋina a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa, anerae erae ainakinet ŋin apei aloboro a ŋulu ke ekal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani kelemu iŋes ainakinet ŋin aŋuna a epito keŋ, eruwor ainakinet ŋin ŋina a epito a ŋol akitodol ekaru ŋolo elakarere epito ŋol, kinyakakinae nai ekepukan ainakinet ŋin, erae ainakinet ŋin eborosit a ŋidwe a ekepukan a ŋulusapa, emaikina inakinae ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyemaikina ekepukan todemana ŋituŋa ibore ŋini erae ŋini kec, emaikina iŋes inak ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ibore ŋini eruwor ŋini kec aloboro keŋ a elope, ikotere nai nyedemar idio alotuŋa kaŋ ibore ŋini erae ŋini kec.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol eketorunio ayoŋ lopuke ŋolo ayai diyete ŋagulei ŋuna asegak ŋuna aya lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, atyakaritae ŋagulei ŋun aŋuna a ŋisacaradotin, abu ayoŋ eŋolik a nen akibois ŋina ewasi jik alowae a ŋolo alo To. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema ekile ŋol neni kaŋ, “Erae akibois ŋin neni ipooto ŋisacaradotin akiriŋ a ŋainakineta a ŋuna ka akiilit anasecit ka ŋuna ka asecit ta neni ipooto ikes ŋainakineta aŋuna a ŋikinyom ikotere ikes nyelomuniata ŋainakineta ŋun nalapatu ŋina alokiŋa, yaasi asegis neni a ŋituŋa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoyau ayoŋ kiŋa, nalapatu ŋina alokiŋa, okoriko ayoŋ, eketoryo lokoonae ŋuluomwon ŋulu ka alapatu a ŋina alokiŋa, a ŋolokoona analapatu a ŋin, ayai neni alapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋikoonae ŋuluomwon ŋul ŋulu ka alapatu a ŋina alokiŋa, ayai alapatu a ŋolokoona, arae aoyau alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka arae aoyau anakou ka neni iteotor ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋikan. Eriyan ŋalapatui ŋunaomwon ŋun daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arekinitae arwatata ŋina a ŋamoru nawaetin a ŋinalapatu a ŋunaomwon a ŋun, anaŋakinitae ecoto alokwap ŋamoru kiryam arwatata daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai ekile ŋol neni kaŋ, “Erae ŋul ŋikenoi ŋulu ipooto ŋulu itiyaete Kai ka Akuj ŋamuronisya ŋuna eyaununeete ŋituŋa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
